# Description: Find the cheapest hotels in an area with cross-platform price comparison. Takes just three parameters: location, check-in and check-out date. Can also sweep upcoming dates to find the cheapest check-in day, or track how the floor price moves. Google source needs no dependencies.
"""
hotel-deals — 酒店比价 CLI

Google 旅游搜索的日期/币种编在一个叫 ts 的参数里(base64url 过的 protobuf)，
自己拼得出来，所以查任意日期只要一条 HTTP 请求，不用开浏览器 —— 这是本脚本
零依赖、且能几十秒扫完 30 天的前提。Booking 挡纯 HTTP(返回 202 挑战页)，
